-- N2 example sentences, batch 1: regardless of, based on, and around.
--
-- N2 is where the patterns stop being verb endings and start being set
-- phrases built on a particle. にかかわらず, にもかかわらず, を問わず and
-- にわたって set a scope; を皮切りに, を込めて, を巡って, に基づいて,
-- をもとに and に応じて say what a thing rests on or revolves around.
--
-- SKIPPED: 〜をものともせず (slug wo-kiniseze) is NOT in this seed. せず —
-- the literary negative of する — shreds to せ|ず in every form tried
-- (ものともせず, ものともせずに, 物ともせず), because the index holds する in
-- kanji-stemmed compounds and not as bare kana. ものともしない cuts clean, but
-- it is a different surface form from the one the topic teaches, and shipping
-- it would put four sentences under a pattern none of them contains. The topic
-- wants a lexicon entry for せず, which is not something a seed should do, so
-- 〜にわたって was brought forward from 310 in its place and wo-kiniseze is
-- left uncovered.
--
-- One rewording: をめぐって in kana shreds to を|め|ぐ. 巡る is a published
-- word, so the four sentences use を巡って — same phrase, spelled the way the
-- index can see it.
--
-- Additive, idempotent, safe on a live database.

  -- ni-kakawarazu
  ('sent-ex-nikakawarazu-1', 'lang-ja', '天気にかかわらず、試合は行います。', 'てんき に かかわらず、しあい わ おこないます。', 'lvl-ja-n2', 'authored', true),
  ('sent-ex-nikakawarazu-2', 'lang-ja', '結果にかかわらず、最後までやります。', 'けっか に かかわらず、さいご まで やります。', 'lvl-ja-n2', 'authored', true),
